        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{875}{209952}$",
          "worked": "Let $X$ be the number of sixes. Then $X\\sim\\operatorname{Bin}(8,\\frac16)$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}P(X=5)&=\\binom85\\left(\\frac16\\right)^5\\left(\\frac56\\right)^3\\\\P(X=5)&=\\frac{875}{209952}.\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
