        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{175}{419904}$",
          "worked": "Let $X$ be the number of sixes. Then $X\\sim\\operatorname{Bin}(8,\\frac16)$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}P(X=6)&=\\binom86\\left(\\frac16\\right)^6\\left(\\frac56\\right)^2\\\\P(X=6)&=\\frac{175}{419904}.\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
