      {
        "id": "p36-q8-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "at least 7 sixes",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{41}{1679616}$",
          "worked": "Let $X$ be the number of sixes. Then $X\\sim\\operatorname{Bin}(8,\\frac16)$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}P(X\\ge7)&=P(X=7)+P(X=8)\\\\P(X\\ge7)&=\\binom87\\left(\\frac16\\right)^7\\left(\\frac56\\right)+\\left(\\frac16\\right)^8\\\\P(X\\ge7)&=\\frac{40+1}{1679616}\\\\P(X\\ge7)&=\\frac{41}{1679616}.\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
