        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{1015625}{1679616}$",
          "worked": "Let $X$ be the number of sixes. Then $X\\sim\\operatorname{Bin}(8,\\frac16)$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}P(X<2)&=P(X=0)+P(X=1)\\\\P(X<2)&=\\left(\\frac56\\right)^8+8\\left(\\frac16\\right)\\left(\\frac56\\right)^7\\\\P(X<2)&=\\frac{390625+625000}{1679616}\\\\P(X<2)&=\\frac{1015625}{1679616}.\\end{aligned}$$",
